        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "HaptiX brings Taptic Engine feedback to every corner of iOS — hardware buttons, the keyboard, UI controls, navigation gestures, and more. Fine-tune which interactions fire and dial in the exact feedback style that feels right.",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 8
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Haptic Style",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Choose from five distinct feedback intensities:\n\n• **Light** — subtle, gentle tap\n\n• **Medium** — balanced, everyday feel\n\n• **Heavy** — firm, pronounced click\n\n• **Soft** — rounded, cushioned pulse\n\n• **Rigid** — sharp, mechanical snap",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Hardware & System",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• **Volume Buttons** — each press up or down\n\n• **Power Button** — single press\n\n• **Lock / Unlock Events** — screen lock from any source\n\n• **Home Screen Icons** — tap highlight on the home screen\n\n• **App Switcher & Gestures** — swipe-up and card transitions",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "App Interfaces",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• **Keyboard** — every key tap and backspace\n\n• **Standard Buttons** — interacting with buttons across all apps\n\n• **Toggles & Switches** — turning settings on or off\n\n• **Lists & Menus** — selecting items in any menu\n\n• **Scroll Boundaries** *(opt-in)* — a subtle bump when you reach the top or bottom of a scrolling page",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Per-App Exclusions",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Turn off HaptiX for specific apps via the **Excluded Apps** menu. It disables itself automatically in those apps — no respring or restart needed.",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Settings & Preferences",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "All toggles and settings apply instantly. There is no delay and no need to respring your device. It just works seamlessly across all your downloaded and native Apple apps.",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSeparatorView"
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "Compatibility",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**iOS 13 – 17**\n\n• **Rootless** — Dopamine, RootHide, palera1n\n\n• **Rootful** — palera1n\n\n• **Legacy** — checkra1n, unc0ver, Electra (iOS 13–14)",
          "useRawFormat": false
        },
